#: ../doc/effects.rst:382
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Mask: Source`, :guilabel:`Mask Mode`, :guilabel:`Mask: Time "
"Mode`, :guilabel:`Mask: Loop`, and :guilabel:`Mask: Invert` properties limit"
" where an effect is applied. The mask source can be a static image, image "
